invariant: INV-55
file: tls_write.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_write never sends the answer a request owes, so a peer that
  asked for a KeyUpdate keeps reading under the write key it wanted
  retired. bin/unit requires a KeyUpdate record from the write after a
  request.

--- old
    if (t->key_update_owed) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
